1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,685
Your eyes have a boss too?

2
00:00:04,735 --> 00:00:06,455
Put your hands together
to make a triangle-shaped hole

3
00:00:06,505 --> 00:00:08,605
Stretch out your arms and, with both eyes,
put a far-away object in the middle of the hole

4
00:00:08,655 --> 00:00:11,855
Then close one eye at a time

5
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:15,625
Both eyes open,
object in the middle of the hole

6
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:19,625
Close your left eye

7
00:00:19,675 --> 00:00:24,625
Now close your right eye

8
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:28,395
The eye that was open when the object stayed put
= your boss eye!

9
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:30,815
When you line up the object with the hole,
your brain goes by one eye

10
00:00:30,865 --> 00:00:33,885
Seen from the other eye,
it misses the hole

11
00:00:33,935 --> 00:00:36,055
Just like being right- or left-handed,
you have an eye you use more

12
00:00:36,105 --> 00:00:39,425
More people have
a right boss eye

13
00:00:39,475 --> 00:00:43,195
When you look through a telescope or camera,
you use your boss eye without thinking

14
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:45,445
Which side was your boss eye?

15
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:47,945
NEXT: The same color, but it looks different?
